## Viewer Role Restrictions ✅

All new pages and components now respect viewer role:

| Component | Viewer Behavior |
|-----------|-----------------|
| **APISettings** | Cannot create/delete API keys (buttons blurred) |
| **SSOSettings** | Cannot edit SSO config (inputs disabled) |
| **TriggerManager** | Cannot add/edit/delete triggers (all disabled) |
| **AgentCRMConnector** | Cannot connect/disconnect CRMs (buttons disabled) |

### Implementation Pattern
```tsx
const isViewer = currentTeam?.role === 'viewer';
// ...
<Button disabled={isViewer} className={isViewer ? 'opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed' : ''}>
```

