## Environment Variables Required

| Variable | Feature | How to Get |
|----------|---------|------------|
| `UNDETECTABLE_API_KEY` | Natural Write | [undetectable.ai](https://undetectable.ai) |
| `SERPER_API_KEY` | SEO Keywords | [serper.dev](https://serper.dev) |
| `WORKOS_API_KEY` | SSO | [workos.com](https://workos.com) |
| `WORKOS_CLIENT_ID` | SSO | WorkOS Dashboard |

